60.	What are Controls according to their Functions?
Mövzu: Kompüter sistemlərinin təhlükəsizliyinə giriş
•	Preventative  – stop unauthorized activity. Physical (fences, locks, alarms), technical (antivirus, firewalls, IPS) and administrative (separation of duties, data classification, auditing).
•	Detective  – identify and alert to unauthorized activity in progress or after the fact, e.g. IDS and honeypots.
•	Corrective  – deployed after an incident to repair damage and restore previous state, e.g. patching, quarantining viruses, incident response plans.
