Attribute-Based Access Control (ABAC). Several conditions (department, time of day, device, location) are evaluated at the same time, and access is granted only if all policy conditions are satisfied.
10.	Military intelligence system labels every file as Confidential, Secret, or Top Secret. A soldier with “Secret” clearance can open Confidential and Secret files but is automatically blocked from Top Secret files. No officer can override these rules for an individual. Which access control model does this describe?
Mövzu: Girişə Nəzarət Modelləri
