19.	What is the MITRE ATT&CK Matrix main tactics?
Mövzu: Kibertəhlükəsizlik
•	Reconnaissance  – gathering information to plan an attack.
•	Initial access  – penetrating the target system or network.
•	Execution  – running malicious code on the compromised system.
•	Privilege escalation  – gaining higher-level permissions (e.g. user to administrator).
•	Credential access  – stealing usernames, passwords and other logon credentials.
•	Discovery  – learning which resources can be accessed or controlled.
•	Collection  – gathering data related to the attack goal.
•	Exfiltration  – stealing data from the system.
